IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LLM-PROXY-SIMULATOR.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PROXY-LOG ASSIGN TO 'proxy_access.log'.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  PROXY-LOG.
01  LOG-RECORD          PIC X(100).
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-REQUEST-TYPE     PIC X(20) VALUE "CHAT_COMPLETION".
01  WS-MODEL-TARGET     PIC X(20) VALUE "GPT-4O".
01  WS-STATUS            PIC X(5)  VALUE "200".
01  WS-LOG-LINE          PIC X(100).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "--- STARTING LLM PROXY SIMULATION ---".
    
    * Construction d'une ligne de log formatée pour la gestion API LLM
    STRING 
        "TYPE:" WS-REQUEST-TYPE
        "|MODEL:" WS-MODEL-TARGET
        "|STATUS:" WS-STATUS
        DELIMITED BY "  " INTO WS-LOG-LINE.

    DISPLAY "LOGGING TO FILE: " WS-LOG-LINE.
    
    * Simulation d'un traitement de requête
    IF WS-STATUS = "200" THEN
        DISPLAY "REQUEST PROCESSED SUCCESSFULLY."
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "REQUEST FAILED. CHECK PROXY CONFIG."
    END-IF.

    DISPLAY "--- SIMULATION ENDED ---".
    STOP RUN.